# Biome is this repo's formatter (see biome.json and .vscode/settings.json).
# Editors that auto-attach prettier — Neovim's none-ls registers every
# prettier install it finds — would otherwise reformat files on save with
# prettier's defaults, fighting biome.json (4-space indent) and reflowing
# prose in Markdown that is meant to stay as written.
#
# Ignoring everything makes prettier a no-op here: it echoes input unchanged
# rather than erroring, so editor format-on-save falls through to biome.
**
